  "description": "Key Performance Highlights\n\n⚡ 1500W Peak Motor & 90 N·m Torque: High-torque acceleration engineered for steep urban hills and rugged off-road trails.\n🚀 35 MPH Top Speed (Street-Legal Toggle): Unlock fast, responsive power with display-adjustable speed limiters (20/28 MPH Class 2/3 compliant).\n🔋 48V 20Ah Battery (Up to 65 Miles Range): 960Wh long-capacity power cell built for all-day outdoor adventures without range anxiety.\n🛡️ UL 2849 Fire Safety Certified: Fully tested and certified battery and electrical management system for safe home charging.\n🚵 Full Suspension & Hydraulic Brakes: Dual front and rear shock absorption paired with instant stopping power on sand, snow, or asphalt.\n💪 Heavy-Duty 400 lbs Payload Capacity: Reinforced alloy frame built for heavy-duty gear haul, cargo bags, and adult riders.\n\nWhy Upgrade to Benifore X1T PRO?\nThe Benifore X1T PRO is engineered for riders ready to step up from entry-level eBikes. Combining a foldable fat-tire chassis with 1500W peak output and complete UL 2849 safety certification, it delivers the ideal balance of street-legal versatility, heavy-duty durability, and compact portability for demanding everyday use.\n\nIdeal For\n\nDaily City & Suburban Commuting: Bypass traffic effortlessly with adjustable speed settings for 100% street-legal riding.\n\nOutdoor Adventures & Fishing Trips: Pack your gear with confidence thanks to 20\"x4.0\" fat tires and a 400 lbs payload capacity built for sand, mud, and gravel.\n\nRiders Needing Portability & Strength: Heavy-duty alloy folding frame design allows quick trunk storage without sacrificing load capacity.\n\nPerformance Upgraders: Perfect for riders seeking 90 N·m hill-climbing torque, a massive 960Wh battery (+53% vs standard models), and responsive hydraulic brakes.",
